# Myanmar Discovery

- Read `spec.md` and `agent.md` before changing copy, layout, or interaction.
- Canonical runtime is the Next.js App Router. Do not treat `index.html` as live product.
- Place data belongs in `lib/places.ts`. Editorial CSS belongs in `css/styles.css`.
- Voice: quiet, specific, no brochure adjectives, no booking CTAs.
- Honour skip link, drawer focus, body scroll lock, and `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- After UI changes, verify the reader path: hero → map pin → place plate → drawer.
